        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Hackensack%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "South Hackensack is split into three noncontiguous parts: a northeastern residential core, a western Garfield Park area, and a southern industrial strip in the Meadowlands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        12,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Hackensack%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "NJ Transit buses 161 and 165 connect South Hackensack to Manhattan’s Port Authority, while route 76 heads to Newark and 772 offers local service.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
